            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Number 1",
            "review_text": "ヨッシー\nOsaka, Japan20056 contributions\n0\nBuncher specialty store\nOct 2024 • Couples\nWe had lunch at a Buncher specialty store in the old town. The shop across the street also seemed to be affiliated, with about three shops at the same intersection. Buncha and banh mi were also on the menu, and the next traveler was eating banh mi. Buncher had fried spring rolls and pork skewers, which were light and delicious.\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten November 3, 2024",
