            "review_text": "Yves B\nNorman, Oklahoma201 contributions\n0\nReally good food. Very substantial\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nReally good food. Very substantial portions of excellent Bun Cha for an incredible low price. This is not a fancy place and service is brusque at best. Small stools to sit on, crowded place, but the beer is cold and the food is great. Where else can you get a big bowl of meat, a big plate of nems, delicious fresh herbs, a plate of rice vermicelli, and a cold beer for about $4.50?\nRead more\nWritten February 1, 2020",
